-- one step, two missing verdicts: C4 twice
WORKFLOW bad ( DEFINITION_VERSION "0.1.0", ZQL "x/app.zql", SURFACES "x.face", CALENDAR c VERSION "1", LOCALE fr )
RATIONALE "One step missing two of its three endings."
STEP go
  INVOKES do_it
  IRREVERSIBLE
  ON COMMITTED -> fini
  RATIONALE "ON REJECTED and ON HELD are missing."
TERMINAL fini OUTCOME SUCCESS RATIONALE "Done."
